  - Can run tail  [line 55; editable]
  - Can run find  [line 56; editable]
  - Can run wc  [line 57; editable]
  - Can run tr  [line 58; editable]
  - Can run sort  [line 59; editable]
  - Can run uname  [line 60; editable]
  - Can run python3  [line 61; editable]
  - Can run @@PYREAL@@  [line 62; editable]
